`Cmd/Ctrl+Enter` ----> `Todo: Toggle Box`
`Alt+Enter` ----> `Todo: Toggle Box`
`Alt+D` ----> `Todo: Toggle Done`
`Alt+C` ----> `Todo: Toggle Cancelled`
`Alt+S` ----> `Todo: Toggle Start`
`Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+A` ---->  `Todo: Archive`

Smoke test — Login flow:
  `Scope: post-deploy smoke on staging, web + mobile`
  `Owner: QA-on-duty`

  Pre-checks:
    ☐ Staging build sha matches release tag
    ☐ Test accounts unlocked (qa-user-1, qa-user-2)
    ☐ Feature flag `new_login` ON for staging

  Happy path:
    ☐ Web: login with valid creds → /dashboard within 2s @critical
    ☐ Web: session cookie HttpOnly + Secure
    ☐ Mobile (iOS): login → home tab loaded
    ☐ Mobile (Android): login → home tab loaded

  Edge cases:
    ☐ Wrong password → inline error, no redirect
    ☐ Locked account → "contact support" banner
    ☐ Network drop mid-login → retry button visible
    ☐ Email with unicode (тест@example.com) accepted

  Regressions:
    ☐ Logout clears session + redirects to /login
    ☐ "Remember me" persists across browser restart
    ☐ Password reset email arrives < 1 min

  Sign-off:
    ☐ All items above checked
    ☐ Issues filed for any ✘
    ☐ Slack #releases notified
